     "type": "mask_imgtext",
     "title": "The otherworldly luxury of space and time",
     "text": "<p>eriro combines timeless luxury with authentic Alpine experience. A place of conscious surrender: of freeing oneself, of allowing oneself to be absorbed in the present, of celebrating the art of beginnings in their intrinsically small nature. Rooted in its origins of unadulterated mountain, it is here that the beauty of nature and art of hospitality come together in harmonious equilibrium. Conscious minimalism meets an all-inclusive experience of absolute luxury, bringing the true meaning of simplicity to life. Welcome to eriro.&nbsp;</p>",
